# game/chapter_6.rpy:244
translate brazil chapter_6_cf60e6eb:

#   a "Since she'll seem defenseless and on her own, she'll make an ideal target for the butcher. Or so he'll think."
    a "Como ela parecerá indefesa e sozinha, ela será um alvo ideal para o açougueiro. Ou assim ele pensará."

# game/chapter_6.rpy:245
translate brazil chapter_6_785a5226:

#   a "This means that he's very likely to attack her in the forest if he's, in fact, planning on attacking anyone at the ball."
    a "Isso significa que é muito provável que ele a ataque na floresta se, de fato, estiver planejando atacar alguém no baile."

# game/chapter_6.rpy:247
translate brazil chapter_6_a5cf6d87:

#   a "But what he won't know is that I'll be keeping a loose follow on her."
